From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:30:27 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 394/443] [ae-patch] Wait for the old WebKit recognizer to end
 before a restart starts the new one

WebKit aborts a recognizer started while the old one is still stopping, and the abort lands on the new one. A restart now waits for the old end (capped at 1500 ms), retries once when the new recognizer is aborted within 500 ms, and logs the browser's error message.
